{
	"doc": "Each Warden's signature stance on the shared rig (scripts/match/warden_stance.gd), keyed by archetype id. gait: how the body stands and moves over its class (HunterAnim.STANCE keys: knee, width, lean, bounce, arm, elbow, cadence, stride, fidgets). pose: offsets on the rig's bones, full in idle and blended into run, aim and abilities at the blend weights below. spine: forward lean (rad, + forward). tilt: the shoulders drop toward the weight leg (rad). twist: the shoulders turn (rad, + left). hip: the hips shift over the weight leg (m). lift: the body up (m, + up). back: the hips back (m). knee: extra bend in both knees (rad). spread: the legs wider apart (rad). free_leg: the free leg's hip (+ forward) and knee bend (rad). head: pitch (+ chin up), yaw (+ left), roll (+ toward the left shoulder) (rad). arm_l: the free left hand's place from its rest (m, model space: x right, y up, z back). carry: the weapon's idle place under Aim, pos (m) and rot (pitch, yaw, roll, rad), free_l 1 to let the left hand off it; it blends to the aim pose the moment the Warden fires. leg: the weight leg (l or r). idle: breath (rate, rad/s), breath_amp (x the breathing), shift (s on the weight leg before a short shift to the other), fidget (every and dur in s; body, head, hip and gun offsets at the fidget's peak, wave times over).",
